{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756", "id": 1218426387, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s5In7YT", "number": 1756, "title": "Follow Me messages getting sent in burst form (2 at once)", "user": {"login": "junwoo091400", "id": 23277211, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjc3MjEx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23277211?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400", "html_url": "https://github.com/junwoo091400", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/junwoo091400/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2022-04-28T09:04:49Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-27T09:20:22Z", "closed_at": "2024-05-27T09:20:22Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "## Description\r\nWhile developing the [improved Follow-Me](https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot/pull/19260), **it was spotted that 2 follow-me messages were getting received roughly 0.1 seconds apart. The expected behavior is a steady 1 Hz message received**, therefore it raised speculation that MAVSDK is sending 2 messages around the same time.\r\n\r\nThe Message Burst behavior is shown below, with a **vertical (infinite derivative) plot of data points in Follow-Me messages begin received.** Indicating that they were published around the same time by MAVSDK (burst-published)\r\n\r\n![BothVelTest_Screenshot from 2022-04-28 09-59-04](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/23277211/165715904-38fd4e3b-014b-40c7-8070-381c787d2b23.png)\r\n\r\n## Ways to reproduce\r\n1. Clone the Follow-Me MAVSDK script : https://github.com/junwoo091400/px4-follow-me-sim\r\n2. Follow the instructions of README to install dependencies (which will install MAVSDK v1.2.0 in virtual environment for python)\r\n3. Fetch and checkout the branch that I am developing on : https://github.com/junwoo091400/PX4-Autopilot/tree/followme_refactor\r\n4. Run the SITL with the branch in step.3 : `make px4_sitl gazebo HEADLESS=1 `\r\n5. Run the script in the px4-follow-me-sim repo from step.1 : `python3 follow-target-sim.py --model go_and_stop`\r\n6. Wait for script to run ~ 30 seconds\r\n7. Open the log of SITL with a PlotJuggler\r\n8. Plot the 'follow_target' message logged. It will have vertical plot points like shown above.\r\n\r\n### Logs\r\n[MAVSDK_FollowMe_burst_messages.zip](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/files/8581318/MAVSDK_FollowMe_burst_messages.zip)\r\n* It holds 2 logs where I tested the procedure above with MAVSDK v1.2.0 and v0.22.0 individually.\r\n\r\n## Few Notes\r\n1. There was a fix for a similar (potentially the same) issue 1 year ago : #1405 \r\n2. However the **symptom happens both when using the MAVSDK v1.12.0 (Only a month old) and v0.22.0 (3 years old) - *image attached below**. Even though the Fix PR was added in between :thinking: \r\n3. The burst-sending happens only from time to time (irregularly)\r\n\r\nHere, the left side is a SITL result of using MAVSDK v1.12.0 and right is using v0.22.0:\r\n![LeftMAVSDKv1 12 0_Rightv0 22 0_Screenshot from 2022-04-28 10-47-03](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/23277211/165717645-2af8ed76-e6a4-4eee-856f-8097dd36802a.png)", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/1756/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/commen